    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d226-a4">

                <pb facs="0332" n="226" xml:id="pg226"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4 in No.
                    224.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Proclamation of the intendente of
                    Santiago</hi>.</head>
                <p rendition="#flush">To <hi rendition="#small-caps">the People of
                    Santiago</hi>:</p>
                <p>The rumors circulated in the press in regard to designs against the life of Col.
                    Canto have no foundation. Nobody has been arrested upon the charge and no
                    information has been received to warrant judicial investigation regarding the
                    matter.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Carlos Lira</hi>.</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-11-06"><hi rendition="#italic">November 6,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
